			        " vs " & FORMAT(_Actual/1000000, "0.0M") & " actual) — possible demand drop not captured.",
			        "mixed forecast accuracy (" & FORMAT(_MinF/1000000, "0.0M") & "–" & FORMAT(_MaxF/1000000, "0.0M") & 
